      "instance_name": "Jack_Nicholson",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "A close-up of Jack Nicholson wearing dark sunglasses, with a smug, dismissive expression. He is wearing a black jacket over a green t-shirt. His gray hair is visible, and he appears to be looking slightly upward with a condescending smirk. The background is dark and out of focus, with another person faintly visible behind him. This image is iconic from his role in 'The Shining' and is widely used in memes to convey a sarcastic, self-deprecating, or ironic attitude.",
