    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b1329422",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "smug_dismissive_expression",
      "label": "Jack Nicholson displaying a smug, dismissive expression",
      "description": "The scene centers on Jack Nicholson, who is wearing dark sunglasses and a green t-shirt under a black jacket. His facial expression is smug and slightly condescending, with a smirk and upward gaze. The background is dark and out of focus, with another person faintly visible behind him. The text overlay reads: 'i love it when people think my posts are about them' and 'as if i had enough time to insult you bastards individually.' The scene conveys a sarcastic, self-deprecating attitude toward online interactions where people misinterpret content as being directed at them.",
