      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "sarcastic_detachment",
      "label": "sarcastic and detached emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is a blend of sarcasm and detachment, conveyed through Jack Nicholson's smug, dismissive facial expression and the ironic text overlay. The expression suggests amusement at the absurdity of people misinterpreting online content as being directed at them, while simultaneously mocking the idea that the creator has the time or inclination to target individuals personally.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
